/**
 * Stage D item 3 step 1 arm 'd9' (scripts/stage-d/rez-keep-b-patches.json; a measurement tree, never play): a remote
 * with no agenda in its root is staked by its other root cards when their trash loses the Corp worth (corpCardValue with
